5,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,I want to understand why last year felt so disconnected. I’ll look into how the days actually ran and the time alone we had.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shizue,,I worry about who pays for what. I’ll check the all-in rates and what separate rooms cost last time.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Minato,,I’m a bit worried about sleeping and washing. I’ll look into bathing hours and how last year’s days ran.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,"I’d like to see how much time we lose travelling. I’ll check the ferry and train times, and how last year’s days ran.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Midori,,I want to know the total cost before we commit. I’ll check the offshore house pricing and the all-in rates.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,I’m curious what Minato found about the bathing hours. Does that affect how we plan our evenings?,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Minato, I hope the bathing hours are flexible. I worry about the small routines that make a week comfortable for everyone.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Minato,,"@Shizue, I hope so too. I just want to know when the water is warm and if I can wash without rushing.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,I’m glad we’re checking the travel times. I worry about losing too much of the week just moving.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Midori,,I’m glad we’re looking at the numbers. Knowing the full cost upfront helps me feel secure about saying yes.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,"@Midori, knowing the total cost upfront is wise. I’m still focused on why last year felt so disconnected despite being together.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Shizue,,"@Mizuki, I understand that feeling. I am looking at the costs to see if a single bill might make things feel more settled for all of us.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Minato,,"@Mizuki, I think the bathing hours are important too. If I can wash without rushing, I might feel less tired and more ready to be with everyone.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,"@Mizuki, I agree. If the days ran separately, we were physically together but mentally apart. I want to avoid that.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Midori,,"@Mizuki, I hear you. I hope the numbers I find will help us choose a place where we can truly be together, not just near each other.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Mizuki,,I appreciate your support. I’ll wait for the findings to see if a shared rhythm fixes that disconnect.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Shizue,,I am glad we are all thinking about comfort. I will wait for the numbers to see if a single bill brings peace.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Minato,,"I’m a little nervous, but I hope the answers will help me sleep better. I’ll wait to hear what everyone found out.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,I will wait for the travel times to see if we can keep more of the week for ourselves.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Midori,,I’ll wait for the pricing details too. Knowing the exact total before we book brings me a lot of peace.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
