35,2,1,talk,Mizuki,,"The data confirms my fear. Last year’s separation caused the disconnect, but a shared house offers no privacy. We need a middle ground.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Shizue,,"@Mizuki, a single bill divides evenly, unlike last year’s uneven rooms. That fairness matters to me.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Minato,,"@Mizuki, I found the island houses have only one bathroom and the water runs cold. That worries me. I also saw we barely met last year.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,The ferry eats two full days. The train takes ninety minutes. I would rather lose an hour than a whole day.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Midori,,"The island houses are 5,400 yen a head a night, but food is extra. All-in rates charge everyone the same, regardless of appetite.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Jonathan, the train saves us two days. @Minato, a town with streets and a public bath solves the privacy issue.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Midori, the all-in rate means I pay for appetites I do not have. I prefer settling meals as we actually eat them.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Minato,,"@Mizuki, a town with streets sounds nice. I like the idea of a public bath where I can wash without worrying about the water being cold.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Mizuki, I agree. Ninety minutes is manageable. I would rather spend that time reading on the train than waiting for a ferry.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Midori,,"@Shizue, I understand your concern. I prefer knowing the total upfront, but I also don’t want to pay for food I won’t eat.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Mizuki,,"@Midori, the valley inn folds meals in, so the total is fixed. That solves your cost worry and keeps us together.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Shizue,,"@Mizuki, I see the appeal of a fixed total. Yet I worry about paying for meals I do not eat.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Minato,,"@Mizuki, the inn baths open until midnight. That is good. I can wash whenever I am ready, without rushing.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,"@Mizuki, the ninety-minute train is a relief. I can read a chapter and arrive rested, not drained by ferry waits.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Midori,,"@Mizuki, that is a lovely thought. A fixed total gives me the security I need, and I trust the inn will be generous with portions.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Mizuki,,"I am convinced. The valley inn offers the shared rhythm we need, the privacy a town provides, and the fixed cost Midori wants. I am ready to vote.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Shizue,,"I am glad the train saves us days. A single bill divides evenly, unlike last year’s uneven rooms. That fairness matters to me.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Minato,,"@Mizuki, I am happy too. The baths are open late, so I can wash when I am ready. I feel much better about sleeping now.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Jonathan,,"Ninety minutes is a chapter, not a lost day. I am ready to vote for the valley.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Midori,,"I am relieved. The fixed total gives me the security I need, and the train keeps our week intact. I am ready to vote.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
